{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>埃及首都開羅附近的吉薩省周三（25日）發生嚴重交通事故，一輛運油車在吉薩省環城公路翻側後起火，造成至少31人死亡，21人受傷，波及27輛汽車被燒毁。據中國駐埃及大使館消息，此次事故暫無中國公民傷亡報告。（法新社/新華社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:18:55.649010+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T01:37:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T07:17:38.339869+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T02:12:19.585101+00:00","content_hash":"6b1e5f84d9888c2c675fae3de6e8eabff50e9e92075d803d63315fa2264c5594","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}